---
id: KelolaJadwalPegawai-LihatJadwal
title: Kelola Jadwal Pegawai - Lihat Detail Jadwal
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR/Manager
    participant UI as Web UI :boundary
    participant C as WorkerScheduleController :control
    participant WS as WorkerSchedule Model :entity
    participant DB as Database :entity

    HR->>+UI: Klik pada jadwal untuk melihat detail
    UI->>+C: GET /admin/worker-schedules/{id}
    C->>+WS: Find jadwal dengan relasi worker dan shift
    WS->>+DB: SELECT ws.*, w.name, w.nip, s.name as shift_name, s.start_time, s.end_time FROM worker_schedules ws JOIN workers w JOIN shifts s WHERE ws.id = ?
    DB-->>-WS: Schedule data lengkap
    WS-->>-C: WorkerSchedule instance
    C-->>-UI: Response dengan detail
    UI-->>-HR: Tampilkan: Pegawai, Shift, Tanggal Mulai, Tanggal Akhir, Jam Kerja, Catatan

